  <AutoDumpHeading>true</AutoDumpHeading>
</Query>

/* To enable Claude Code, go to Settings -> Claude Code.

Press Ctrl+Shift+K / Command-Shift+K to activate (or click the Claude tab).

An embedded version of the Claude Code CLI will appear, with access to
the current script and more than 20 native LINQPad tools.

Updates to your script show with full red/green diffing and accept/reject buttons.

Claude Code can also read and update projects on disk, and use LINQPad to debug them.

Claude Code runs with the same login credentials as the normal CLI.

Ask it "What can you do?" for more help.

*/